# CoDev-OSRS agent rules

Read `CLAUDE.md` and `AGENTS.md` before changing product behavior.

- Source of truth: `specs/001-office-supplies-mvp/` (spec → plan → tasks).
- On-demand skills: `.agents/skills/` (tool-agnostic; not `.claude/skills/`).
- Architecture: `ARCHITECT.md`. Domain flow: `docs/process-flow.md`.
- Three roles only: Employee, Approver, Supply Admin. No combined Admin.
- Inventory: decrement on submit, restore on reject, never negative.
- Do not invent REST routes, payloads, or error codes; consume the backend team’s contract.
- Do not implement features that are not in the active spec.
- TypeScript; no secrets in git; mark `tasks.md` items `[x]` only when done.
